  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries. Place on lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt, sprinkle over mixed sesame seeds and toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857565ed750df6e30e6e3d/step-f723fdda.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, remove centre veins from makrut lime leaves, then very finely chop. Slice tomato into rounds.\n• Pat dry firm tofu with paper towel and slice lengthways to get 2 steaks per person.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, makrut lime leaves, the soy sauce and vinegar. TIP: The makrut lime leaves are fibrous so you want to cut them into small pieces!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857565ed750df6e30e6e3d/step-582716ec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When fries have 5 minutes remaining, in a medium bowl, combine tofu, cornflour and the salt.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When the oil is hot, shake excess flour off the tofu and cook, 2 minutes each side.\n• Add sweet chilli mixture, turning to coat, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857565ed750df6e30e6e3d/step-68abae16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857565ed750df6e30e6e3d/step-06d75310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread each bun with mango mayonnaise.\n• Top with makrut lime & sweet chilli glazed tofu, spooning over remaining glaze from pan.\n• Top with mixed salad leaves, tomato and burger bun top.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857565ed750df6e30e6e3d/step-f0671ac5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide makrut lime & sweet chilli glazed tofu burger and sesame fries between plates.\n• Serve with any remaining mango mayo. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63857565ed750df6e30e6e3d/step-da7b5f12.jpg"
    }
  ]
